  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Chọn hệ trục toạ độ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> như hình vẽ.<br>\n\t\t\tParabol thứ nhất có đỉnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, và đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tParabol thứ hai có đỉnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> và đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/1c2ed05e040d0ee8ba3e70d631a2acfd75596380e75156e9ce5a62bfaabc71b0.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t Xét phương trình hoành độ giao điểm \n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDiện tích hình phẳng giới hạn bởi hai đường parabol là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>S</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></munderover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></msubsup><mo>≈</mo><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>33978</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t Số tiền cần chi là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>33978</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>45</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2715</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (nghìn).",
